    57	# The registered EVAL cap (plan §2 chunk plan / §5 template): batch 64 needs a
    58	# cap of at least 64, because an orbit chunk is whole angles and cannot be split
    59	# below one. Eval mode draws no RoPE rescale, so the cap is protocol identity,
